  <name>Stream Tube</name>
  <summary>A fast native YouTube client without ads</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Stream Tube is a native desktop YouTube client. It plays videos directly through
      libmpv, so there are no ads, and it skips sponsor reads with SponsorBlock.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Home, Shorts, subscriptions, channels, playlists, search and live streams with chat</li>
      <li>SponsorBlock, DeArrow titles and thumbnails, and Return YouTube Dislike</li>
      <li>Background play, picture-in-picture, downloads and audio-only mode</li>
      <li>Local subscriptions and history, or sign in to use your YouTube account</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
